      "data": {
        "text": "\"Nephilim-class suppression forces. Genetic engineering optimized for high-resilience biological management. Consciousness-disruption capabilities exceeding current Reptilian specifications. Estimated requirement: ten thousand units distributed across all sites. Alternative: psychological warfare continuation, await indigenous self-suppression through implanted division protocols before deploying military assets.\"",
